{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2019-chemistry-19","exam":"MDEET","year":2019,"subject":"chemistry","number":19,"points":4,"unitId":"lab","unitLabel":"실험·분석화학","topic":"실험과정·여과","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["lab","organic_properties","equilibrium"],"stem":"다음은 고체 용해도의 온도 의존성을 이용한 분별 결정 실험이다.\n<용해도 자료>\n<실험 과정>\n(가) Na2Cr2O7 21g(0.080mol)과 KCl 12g(0.16mol)을 증류수\n100mL 에 가한 후, 가열하여 고체를 완전히 녹였다.\n(나) 용액을 약 10℃로 냉각시켜 ㉠결정을 석출시켰다.\n(다) 감압 여과 장치를 이용하여 결정을 걸러내었다.\n(라) 과정 (다)에서 남겨진 용액을 80℃ 이상으로 가열해서 용액의\n1로 줄어들 때까지 농축하여 ㉡결정을 석출시킨\n부피가 약 ―5\n후 걸러내었다. \n(마) 과정 (라)에서 남겨진 용액을 약 10℃로 냉각시켜 ㉢결정을\n석출시켰다.\n결정 ㉠～㉢의 주성분이 옳게 짝을 지은 것은?\n㉠\n㉡\n㉢","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"K2Cr2O7  NaCl KCl","assetIds":["fig-03"],"textItemIds":["t018","t019","t020","t021"]},{"number":2,"text":"K2Cr2O7 NaCl K2Cr2O7","assetIds":["fig-04"],"textItemIds":["t022","t023","t024","t025"]},{"number":3,"text":"K2Cr2O7 KCl NaCl","assetIds":["fig-05"],"textItemIds":["t026","t027","t028","t029"]},{"number":4,"text":"Na2Cr2O7 Na2Cr2O7  KCl","assetIds":["fig-06"],"textItemIds":["t030","t031","t032","t033"]},{"number":5,"text":"Na2Cr2O7 K2Cr2O7  KCl","assetIds":["fig-07"],"textItemIds":["t034","t035","t036","t037"]}],"answer":2,"acceptedAnswers":[2],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":771,"height":1041,"region":0,"bbox":[14.68,35.703,308.4,416.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2019-chemistry-19/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":481,"height":6,"region":0,"bbox":[68.28,515.703,192.4,2.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2019-chemistry-19/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":82,"height":18,"region":0,"bbox":[67.08,532.103,32.8,7.2]